# The window tests natively, over SDL3: haxe build-native.hxml -> native/WindowTests; hxcpp compiles the adapters' C with it and links the
# SDL3 library HELIX_SDL3_LIBRARY names (BUILDING.md). It prints {passed, checks, failures, answers} and exits 1 on a failure. Run it on a
# private display (tools/private_display.py): it opens, moves, hides and fullscreens a window.
-lib helix-platform
-cp .
-main WindowTests
-dce full
-D HXCPP_COMPILE_THREADS=4
-cpp native
